@startuml
title Video Suggestion System - State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state ReceivingRequest
state IdentifyingUser
state GatheringVideos
state AddingDetails
state SendingSuggestions

Idle : entry / Await Request

ReceivingRequest : entry / Receive Video Suggestion Request
ReceivingRequest : do / Listen for request
ReceivingRequest --> IdentifyingUser : Request Received

IdentifyingUser : entry / Identify User
IdentifyingUser : do / Determine User Identity
IdentifyingUser --> GatheringVideos : User Identified

GatheringVideos : entry / Gather Videos
GatheringVideos : do / Fetch videos based on profile, trends, tags, genres, promotions
GatheringVideos --> AddingDetails : Videos Gathered

AddingDetails : entry / Add Details
AddingDetails : do / Add thumbnails and view counts
AddingDetails --> SendingSuggestions : Details Added

SendingSuggestions : entry / Send Suggestions
SendingSuggestions : do / Transmit suggested videos to user
SendingSuggestions --> Idle : Suggestions Sent

@enduml
